LCC-derived components
----------------------

Components derived from the LCC compiler by Christopher W. Fraser and David
R. Hanson are distributed under the original LCC license. The complete,
unchanged LCC license is in:

    LICENSES/LCC.txt

The original LCC license notice must be preserved with copies and
modifications of LCC-derived software.

Historical warranty excerpt
---------------------------

The upstream distribution also includes a separate historical NO WARRANTY
excerpt in:

    LICENSES/NO_WARRANTY.txt

It is not part of the LCC license and does not make LCC-derived components
GPL-licensed. Unless a file states otherwise, its license is determined by
the component from which it originates.

